## 8. Example config

```yaml
models:
  - name: fast-small
    provider: openai
    model_id: YOUR_CHEAP_MODEL
    cost_per_1k_input: 0.0002
    cost_per_1k_output: 0.0008
    max_context: 128000
    tier: easy

  - name: strong-large
    provider: anthropic
    model_id: YOUR_STRONG_MODEL
    cost_per_1k_input: 0.003
    cost_per_1k_output: 0.015
    max_context: 200000
    tier: hard

  - name: local
    provider: ollama
    model_id: YOUR_LOCAL_MODEL
    cost_per_1k_input: 0
    cost_per_1k_output: 0
    tier: easy

routing:
  strategy: rules
  default: fast-small
  fallbacks: [strong-large, local]
  rules:
    - if: { has_code: true }
      use: strong-large
    - if: { input_tokens_gt: 50000 }
      use: strong-large
```

Replace the `YOUR_*` placeholders with current model IDs and prices from each provider's documentation.

