## 9. Risks and how to handle them

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Router picks a weak model and quality drops | Build the eval set early; use cascade as a safety net |
| Router adds too much latency | Keep the preprocessor and scorer lightweight; measure overhead |
| Provider APIs change | Keep adapters small and isolated; add contract tests |
| Leaked API keys | Use environment variables only; add `.env` to `.gitignore`; never commit keys |
| Prices and models go out of date | Keep all prices in config, not in code |

